WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.078
This is a small workbench for comparing the shapes of folding knives.

2
00:00:05.818 --> 00:00:12.756
On the right, about a hundred knives, rebuilt from openly published photographs and specifications.

3
00:00:13.496 --> 00:00:21.689
Each photograph has been processed: outline traced, blade and handle separated, pivot located, true scale restored.

4
00:00:22.429 --> 00:00:25.605
The tools on the left all rest on that work.

5
00:00:26.345 --> 00:00:33.573
The aim is simple: to discover, learn and try things out, on knives I own, or simply like.

6
00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:37.852
You may notice a certain fondness for Spyderco.

7
00:00:38.592 --> 00:00:40.996
Let's pick three knives.

8
00:00:41.736 --> 00:00:46.333
They can be stacked one below the other, all at the same scale,

9
00:00:47.073 --> 00:00:49.527
set side by side,

10
00:00:50.267 --> 00:00:52.979
or laid on top of each other.

11
00:00:53.719 --> 00:01:00.734
Every knife carries its points of interest: the tip, the pivot, the junction of blade and handle, and the butt,

12
00:01:01.474 --> 00:01:05.735
along with the centre of area of its blade and of its handle.

13
00:01:06.475 --> 00:01:11.693
Axes join them: pivot to tip, butt to pivot, junction to tip.

14
00:01:12.433 --> 00:01:16.772
The knives can be aligned on any of these points: the tip,

15
00:01:17.512 --> 00:01:19.300
the junction,

16
00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:24.052
or the pivot, where blade and handle meet in motion.

17
00:01:24.792 --> 00:01:30.143
Each one can also be levelled on an axis: pivot to tip, to compare the blades,

18
00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:35.274
or pivot to butt, to compare the handles as the hand holds them.

19
00:01:36.014 --> 00:01:39.001
The whole set can then be turned together.

20
00:01:39.741 --> 00:01:45.142
After a quick screen calibration, every knife appears at its real size.

21
00:01:45.882 --> 00:01:52.284
So play with your favourite knives, compare them, and imagine how each one would behave on a cutting board.

22
00:01:53.024 --> 00:01:55.807
Suggestions are most welcome.

